<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Quantifying Compositionality of Classic and State-of-the-Art Embeddings" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Additive Compositionality by Model</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Quantifying Compositionality of Classic and State-of-the-Art Embeddings" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Compositionality across Layers and Training Stages</span></a>
