<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(b) </span>Cosine Similarity (SBERT)</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_4">
<figure id="S4.F3.sf3" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2509.19332v1/figures/sentence_hits5_bert.png" id="S4.F3.sf3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/286;" width="476" height="286" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(c) </span>Retrieval Accuracy@5 (SBERT)</figcaption>
